! Bot1.Hand.Glyph of Reincarnation.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Phyrexian Walker)
Bot2.Block(Steel Wall > Phyrexian Walker)
[T5 Bot1.EndCombat]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glyph of Reincarnation.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Steel Wall)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Warrior Token)
Bot1.Choose(Phyrexian Walker; Ornithopter)
